# vim: filetype=yaml sw=2
filename: '[% project %]-[% c("version") %]-[% c("var/osname") %]-[% c("var/arch") %]-[% c("var/build_id") %].tar.gz'
version: '[% c("var/versions/ricochet-refresh") %]'
git_url: '[% c("var/git_urls/ricochet-refresh") %]'
git_hash: '[% c("var/git_hashes/ricochet-refresh") %]'
git_submodule: 1
container:
  use_container: 1

var:
  pluggable_transports: 1
  deps:
    - gettext

targets:
  testbuild:
    fetch: 1
    version: '3.1-testbuild-[% exec("git rev-parse --short HEAD") %]'

  linux-i686:
    var:
      arch_deps:
        - libwxgtk3.2-dev:i386
  linux-x86_64:
    var:
      arch_deps:
        - libwxgtk3.2-dev
  linux-aarch64:
    var:
      pluggable_transports: 0
      arch_deps:
        - libwxgtk3.2-dev:arm64
input_files:
  - project: container-image
  - name: rust
    project: rust
  - name: build-toolchain
    project: '[% c("var/build-toolchain") %]'
  - name: wxWidgets
    project: wxWidgets
    enable: '[% c("var/windows") || c("var/macos") %]'
  - name: ricochet-refresh-cargo-vendor
    project: ricochet-refresh-cargo-vendor
    norec:
      sha256sum: '[% IF !c("var/testbuild") %]0b19e9a40bd9561620ba2b743f041a49fef4340504ec793825d2ebf586c3559d[% END -%]'
  - name: cmake
    project: cmake
  - name: tor
    project: tor
  - name: tor-expert-bundle
    URL: https://archive.torproject.org/tor-package-archive/torbrowser/[% c("var/versions/tor-expert-bundle") %]/tor-expert-bundle-[% c("var/osname") %]-[% c("var/arch") %]-[% c("var/versions/tor-expert-bundle") %].tar.gz
    sig_ext: asc
    file_gpg_id: 1
    gpg_keyring: tor-browser.gpg
    enable: '[% c("var/pluggable_transports") %]'
